    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se tient immobile au milieu des plaines et passe son temps à observer la course du soleil dans le ciel. Son jeu de jambes est phénoménal.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It stands in grasslands, watching the sun’s descent from zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent for delivering dynamic kicks.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "大草原の　中で　たたずみ 陽の　傾きを　眺めて　暮らす。 ダイナミックな　蹴り技が　得意。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Tous les ans à la même date, ils arrivent de nulle part pour se réunir en cercle. C’est une de leurs coutumes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Once a year, on a specific date and at a specific time, they gather out of nowhere and form up in a circle.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "１年に　一度　きまった　日時に どこから　ともなく　集まり　輪に なって　並ぶ　習性が　ある。",
